r bankruptcies in Europe, and that's weighed on cost reduction efforts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/garrett-motion-inc-gtx-q2-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"GTX 2019 Q3","e":"gtx","d":"2019-11-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Peter Bracke","x":"…million in the quarter and down from Q3 last year, which includes a tax benefit from an internal restructuring of Garrett's business in advance of the spin-off that resulted in an $870 million reduction to withholding taxes on undistributed foreign earnings recorded during the three months…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/09/garrett-motion-inc-gtx-q3-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"GTX 2019 Q3","e":"gtx","d":"2019-11-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Olivier Rabiller","x":"Based on our positive results for the third quarter and year-to-date, we reiterated our 2019 guidance for organic net sales and adjusted level free cash flow conversion and revised slightly our full-year outlook for adjusted EBITDA to reflect the effect of a faster rebalancing of our light…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/09/garrett-motion-inc-gtx-q3-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"GTX 2020 Q1","e":"gtx","d":"2020-05-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Joe Spak","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/12/garrett-motion-inc-gtx-q1-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"GTX 2020 Q1","e":"gtx","d":"2020-05-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Joe Spak","x":"And if we're entering this period over the next couple of years where volumes might be a little bit lower for longer than thought, is there more you can do on the cost out?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/12/garrett-motion-inc-gtx-q1-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"GTX 2020 Q1","e":"gtx","d":"2020-05-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Joe Spak","x":"Is there some more restructuring you can do?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/12/garrett-motion-inc-gtx-q1-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"GTX 2025 Q2","e":"gtx","d":"2025-07-24","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Eric Burge","x":"In terms of these large turbos for backup data center, AI, and whatnot, can you give us a sense of when you think that business or if you think that business will ever get to as much as 10% of revenues or I don't want to limit you there, but how big do you think that business can grow and how's…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/24/garrett-motion-gtx-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GTX 2025 Q2","e":"gtx","d":"2025-07-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Olivier Rabiller","x":"Adjusted EBIT was $124 million, and our adjusted EBIT margin was 13.6%, including 30 basis points of margin rate dilution from tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/24/garrett-motion-gtx-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GTX 2025 Q2","e":"gtx","d":"2025-07-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Sean Deason","x":"Our net sales were $913 million, driven by favorable foreign currency impacts, tariff recoveries, and new gasoline launches and ramp-ups in Europe and North America, partially offset by continued weakness in diesel and aftermarket.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/24/garrett-motion-gtx-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GTX 2025 Q2","e":"gtx","d":"2025-07-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Olivier Rabiller","x":"We are also raising our outlook for 2025 to reflect the euro-dollar exchange rate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/24/garrett-motion-gtx-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GTX 2025 Q2","e":"gtx","d":"2025-07-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Sean Deason","x":"We are raising our 2025 outlook to reflect the impact of a stronger euro-U.S. dollar exchange rate, reaffirming our commitment to deliver operating performance consistent with our prior outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/24/garrett-motion-gtx-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GTX 2026 Q1","e":"gtx","d":"2026-04-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Sean Deason","x":"Our margin rate of 15.3% reflects a 40 basis point improvement year-over-year, 20 basis points of which are due to favorable foreign exchange currency impacts, partially offset by tariff pass-throughs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/garrett-motion-gtx-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GTX 2026 Q3","e":"gtx","d":"2026-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Sean Deason","x":"This included an unfavorable 3 points of impact from tariff pass-throughs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/garrett-motion-gtx-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GTX 2026 Q3","e":"gtx","d":"2026-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Sean Deason","x":"I would just add on to that some of that negativity is driven by tariff pass-throughs as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/garrett-motion-gtx-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GTX 2026 Q3","e":"gtx","d":"2026-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Olivier Rabiller","x":"Indeed, we have the negative pass-through of tariffs that is impacting the revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/garrett-motion-gtx-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GTX 2026 Q3","e":"gtx","d":"2026-10-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Olivier Rabiller","x":"Overall, despite foreign exchange headwinds, our year-to-date performance and ability to adapt in a still uncertain industry environment gives us confidence to reaffirm our 2026 outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/garrett-motion-gtx-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[37,1,6367,0,0,0,5348,754],[38,1,6250,0,0,0,51